Project Executable Files
1. Project Platform

The project is developed and executed on the ServiceNow platform.

2. Project Components

The project contains:

User configuration
Role configuration
Custom table
Table fields
READ ACL
CREATE ACL
WRITE ACL
DELETE ACL
3. Project Execution

The project is executed by logging into ServiceNow and accessing the configured Institution Details table.

4. Execution Process
Login to ServiceNow.
Verify the user role.
Access the Institution Details table.
Perform the permitted operation.
Verify the ACL response.
5. Execution Result

The system provides or denies access according to the configured ACL rules.
